### FilmFuse core-api - admin portal. Token: see me.http; the account must have profiles.role = 'admin'
# (granted in SQL only - see CLAUDE.md "Admin portal"). A non-admin gets 404 on every path here, no token 401.
# Writes are rate limited (admin-writes, 60 per 10 minutes) and recorded in the audit log.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@reportId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Am I an admin? (isAdmin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Metrics: catalog (movies, certification, vote tiers, rejects, database size vs guard / plan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/metrics/catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Metrics: usage (users, ratings per day for 30 UTC days, sessions, active groups)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/metrics/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Metrics: health (ML /health, dirty taste vectors, open reports)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/metrics/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Jobs: schedule, next run, paused, last / recent runs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Run the nightly top-up now (202 + runId; 409 ALREADY_RUNNING while a catalog job holds the lock)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/jobs/catalog-top-up/run
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Run the weekly refresh now
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/jobs/catalog-refresh/run
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pause / resume scheduled runs (Run now still works while paused)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/jobs/catalog-refresh/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/jobs/catalog-refresh/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Runtime settings (effective value, default, bounds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change one (400 + fieldErrors.value when out of bounds or the wrong type; unknown key 400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/catalog.top-up.size
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 1500}

### Booleans take true / false
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/catalog.quality.require-poster
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": false}

### Back to the configured default
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/catalog.top-up.size
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reports queue (status OPEN default, oldest first | RESOLVED | DISMISSED; limit 1-100, cursor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reports?status=OPEN&limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resolve or dismiss an OPEN report (404 unknown, 409 already handled; note <= 500 chars)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reports/{{reportId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"resolution": "RESOLVED", "note": "Removed the rating and warned the author"}

### Audit log, newest first (optional action filter; limit 1-100, cursor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/audit-log?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/audit-log?action=SETTING_UPDATE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
